@startuml firmware_layers_en
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Application domain\nConfirm, cancel, error, alarm" as DOMAIN
rectangle "Sequencer\nNotes, BPM, ticks, gate, queue, priority, loop" as SEQUENCER
rectangle "Buzzer driver\nGPIO, LEDC, frequency, duty, safe stop" as DRIVER
rectangle "Electrical stage\nTransistor, push-pull, protection" as ELECTRICAL
rectangle "Transducer\nPiezoelectric or magnetic" as HARDWARE

DOMAIN --> SEQUENCER : sound intent
SEQUENCER --> DRIVER : tone and duration
DRIVER --> ELECTRICAL : waveform
ELECTRICAL --> HARDWARE : voltage and current

note right of DOMAIN
  The application should not
  know about MIDI, LEDC,
  or circuit polarity.
end note
@enduml
